{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NextVisuals Forest</strong> is a next-generation GPU performance benchmark designed to push modern graphics hardware to its limits. Built on state-of-the-art rendering technologies, it delivers an uncompromising visual experience that sets a new standard for fidelity and realism in real-time graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Mode</strong> \u2013 Freely roam the benchmark environment and dynamically adjust the <strong>time of day</strong> to experience lighting and mood transitions in real-time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ultra-High Polygon Density</strong> for intricate, richly detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Global Illumination and Lighting</strong> to simulate realistic light behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardware Ray Tracing</strong> for physically accurate shadows, reflections, and lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Volumetric Fog and Clouds</strong> for immersive atmospheric depth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional gaming benchmarks, <strong>NextVisuals Forest</strong> runs exclusively at high and ultra settings, with native 1:1 screen resolution and no frame upscaling. This ensures a consistent, raw evaluation of hardware capabilities\u2014ideal for users, developers, and reviewers who need forward-looking metrics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note</strong>: Due to its extreme settings, the frame rates achieved are not indicative of performance in typical game scenarios. Reaching 60 FPS at 1080p in this benchmark can often translate to 60 FPS at 4K in actual games using upscaling and tuned settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A score of 10,000 is translated to 60 FPS.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829120?t=1752834486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/b9f9dbaf10cd4ade6d80374855da90c13331e888/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752834486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/328f30a23a2778bf2c8da6b87f6fb4ddba8c118b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752834486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/328f30a23a2778bf2c8da6b87f6fb4ddba8c118b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752834486","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NextVisuals Forest</strong> is a next-generation GPU performance benchmark designed to push modern graphics hardware to its limits. Built on state-of-the-art rendering technologies, it delivers an uncompromising visual experience that sets a new standard for fidelity and realism in real-time graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/e75cd6353305353b31b66143c68655b4.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Mode</strong> \u2013 Freely roam the benchmark environment and dynamically adjust the <strong>time of day</strong> to experience lighting and mood transitions in real-time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/ea5ef335db107ef9d8ad2437862cbf4a.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ultra-High Polygon Density</strong> for intricate, richly detailed environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Global Illumination and Lighting</strong> to simulate realistic light behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardware Ray Tracing</strong> for physically accurate shadows, reflections, and lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Volumetric Fog and Clouds</strong> for immersive atmospheric depth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.poster.avif?t=1752834486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.webm?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/extras/6875defee7e1850cee653e77035cf2d9.mp4?t=1752834486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional gaming benchmarks, <strong>NextVisuals Forest</strong> runs exclusively at high and ultra settings, with native 1:1 screen resolution and no frame upscaling. This ensures a consistent, raw evaluation of hardware capabilities\u2014ideal for users, developers, and reviewers who need forward-looking metrics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note</strong>: Due to its extreme settings, the frame rates achieved are not indicative of performance in typical game scenarios. Reaching 60 FPS at 1080p in this benchmark can often translate to 60 FPS at 4K in actual games using upscaling and tuned settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A score of 10,000 is translated to 60 FPS.</p>","developers":["NextVisuals"],"genres":[{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829120/782ad31838a2342a213b4d4990628fae2399dae1/header.jpg?t=1752834486","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257160347,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160347/movie480.mp4?t=1752567793","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160347/movie_max.mp4?t=1752567793"},"name":"NextVisual Benchmark trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257160347/eb40c65a7e7522c14fd3f0192c02261b7c22433a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752567793","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160347/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752567793","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160347/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752567793"}}],"name":"NextVisuals Benchmark Forest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 30 series<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><str